{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The original is a compact 2017 React app: a live Unix-millisecond timestamp printed on a black shirt, fitted/unisex and size choices, a $22.50 Stripe payment, then Scalable Press design → quote → order. I’m preserving that recognizable idea while updating the architecture and checkout safety: hosted Stripe Checkout, server-side fulfillment, idempotency, input validation, and an explicit Scalable Press test-mode boundary."}}
