      \n  payment_method_configurations            \n  payment_method_domains                   \n  payment_methods                          \n  payment_records                          \n  payment_sources                          \n  payouts                                  \n  persons                                  \n  plans                                    \n  preview                                  \n  prices                                   \n  product_features                         \n  products                                 \n  promotion_codes                          \n  quotes                                   \n  radar                                    \n  refunds                                  \n  reporting                                Run Stripe Sigma queries via the Data Reporting API\n  reporting                                \n  reviews                                  \n  scheduled_query_runs                     \n  setup_attempts                           \n  setup_intents                            \n  shipping_rates                           \n  sources                                  \n  subscription_items                       \n  subscription_schedules                   \n  subscriptions                            \n  tax                                      \n  tax_codes                                \n  tax_ids                                  \n  tax_rates                                \n  terminal                                 \n  test_helpers                             \n  tokens                                   \n  topups                                   \n  transfer_reversals                       \n  transfers                                \n  treasury                                 \n  v2                                       \n  webhook_endpoints                        \n\nUse \"stripe [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n--- Scalable Press auth check ---\nHTTP 404\n{\n  \"statusCode\": 40